    "description": "Individual ASM 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM202 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Individual ASM</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13232 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">TTM202 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Individual ASM</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13232 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: 10-15' each student in class; dividing into 3 sessions; OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Oral presentation; OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Presentation; OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Every chapter; OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: In class presentation: each student will be in charge of one chapter (the lecturer will allocate the chapter to each student). She/he is asked to give her/his reflective review of the theories in that chapter by different ways: a concept map/a video/ a poster/real examples/case study or a game. Then the student will have to present in front of the class to help the whole class to get a good understanding of the chapter. Depending on the class size, lecturer can be flexible to decide how many students will work on the same chapter. But they will have to work independently and with seperated parts.<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Individual ASM submission before Tests<br><br>OP2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 2 — Individual assignment guide</li><li>Session 17 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 1</li><li>Session 18 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 1 (cont'd)</li><li>Session 37 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 2</li><li>Session 38 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 2 (cont'd)</li><li>Session 53 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 3</li><li>Session 54 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 3 (cont'd)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 2 — Individual assignment guide</li><li>Buổi 17 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 1</li><li>Buổi 18 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 1 (cont'd)</li><li>Buổi 37 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 2</li><li>Buổi 38 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 2 (cont'd)</li><li>Buổi 53 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 3</li><li>Buổi 54 — Individual assignment: Individual presentations 3 (cont'd)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
